set security zones security-zone vpn interfaces st0.1 host-inbound-traffic system-services ping
set security zones security-zone trust interfaces ge-0/0/1.151 host-inbound-traffic system-services ping
set security zones security-zone trust interfaces ge-0/0/1.152 host-inbound-traffic system-services ping
set security zones security-zone untrust screen untrust-screen
